  <div class="w3-row-padding w3-padding-16 w3-center" id="food">
    <div class="w3-quarter">
      <img src="https://images.albertsons-media.com/is/image/ABS/970482134-C1N1?$ng-ecom-pdp-mobile$&defaultImage=Not_Available" alt="Sandwich" style="width:100%">
      <h3>Head & Shoulders Dry Scalp Care Dandruff Shampoo</h3>
      <p>Head & Shoulders Dry Scalp Care can help reduce dandruff for some people and is affordable and easy to find, but results vary depending on hair and scalp type. In my experience, it irritated my scalp, caused noticeable hair fall, dried out my hair and scalp, and actually led to more dandruff buildup instead of improving it.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="w3-quarter">
      <img src="https://encrypted-tbn0.gstatic.com/shopping?q=tbn:ANd9GcSohn6FQKvfj0Su6R6EP75YoWLUPWCgCJGXIadX0nbTEiHH0fDKWpaNEQdR0tB2X6bUX0d_tIrBv4A28xIVjJOtL7ZeEUTf_w" alt="Steak" style="width:100%">
      <h3>Garnier Fructis Sleek Shine Intensely Smooth Leave-In Conditioning Cream</h3>
      <p>Garnier Fructis Sleek & Shine Leave-In Conditioning Cream helps reduce frizz and leaves hair feeling soft, smooth, and more manageable at an affordable price. In my friend’s experience, it made her hair feel softer, less damaged from heat styling, easier to detangle, reduced split ends, and gave her hair a thicker feel, though it doesn’t address scalp issues like dandruff.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="w3-quarter">
      <img src="https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/515p+tOdMeL._AC_UF1000,1000_QL80_.jpg" alt="Cherries" style="width:100%">
      <h3>Native Volumizing Shampoo and Contidtioner</h3>
      <p>Native Volume Shampoo and Conditioner are gentle, sulfate-free, and cruelty-free, leaving hair smooth, moisturized, and more voluminous. In my experience, while my hair felt healthier and shinier, my dandruff didn’t improve and even seemed worse over time, showing it’s better for volume and texture than scalp care.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="w3-quarter">
      <img src="https://www.mountainside-medical.com/cdn/shop/files/Ketoconazole-Antifungal-Medicated-Shampoo-2_-by-Padagis-NDC--45802-0465-64_700x700.jpg?v=1748520406" alt="Pasta and Wine" style="width:100%">
      <h3>Ketoconazole Shampoo 2% Medicated</h3>
      <p>Ketoconazole 2% shampoo is a strong medicated option that effectively treats dandruff, seborrheic dermatitis, and other scalp fungal issues while reducing itching and flaking. I got this shampoo recommended by my dermatologist, and in my experience it worked really well. My dandruff was gone after two weeks, my hair felt more moisturized and healthy, and my scalp felt refreshed and nourished. However, it can cause dryness, irritation, or changes in hair texture for some and is not meant for daily use.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
 
  <!-- Second Photo Grid-->
  <div class="w3-row-padding w3-padding-16 w3-center">
    <div class="w3-quarter">
      <img src="https://i.redd.it/khleidw1k6eb1.jpg" alt="Hair Thinning and Hair loss" style="width:80%">
      <h3>Hair thinning and Hair loss</h3>
      <p>When I first started using the Head & Shoulders Dry Scalp Care Dandruff Shampoo, I didn’t notice any immediate issues with my hair. However, the more I used it, the more my hair started to shed and my scalp became increasingly visible, my scalp just like this picture, which really affected my confidence. My dandruff worsened, and my scalp became flaky and irritated, making me realize that this shampoo was not working for my hair and scalp as I had hoped.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="w3-quarter">
      <img src="https://shop.briogeohair.com/cdn/shop/articles/before_after_1200x1200_5d579191-d013-4a22-b39b-38becadca10d.jpg?v=1553625907&width=888" alt="Salmon" style="width:100%">
      <h3>Splitends Care</h3>
      <p>As my friend said, the Garnier Fructis Sleek Shine Intensely Smooth Leave-In Conditioning Cream helped with her split ends and made her hair feel soft, smooth, and manageable. It also gave her hair a clean and fresh look, but despite these benefits, she still struggled with dandruff, so it didn’t fully solve her scalp issues.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="w3-quarter">
      <img src="https://img-cdn.philipkingsley.com/media/mageplaza/blog/post/m/a/man_grabbing_hair.jpg" alt="Sandwich" style="width:100%">
      <h3>Hair loss issues</h3>
      <p>At first, my hair felt softer, smoother, and more voluminous with the Native shampoo and conditioner. However, after a while, I noticed hair loss and scalp irritation, so I decided to stop using it since it didn’t suit my scalp and hair needs.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="w3-quarter">
      <img src="https://mail.google.com/mail/u/0?ui=2&ik=5543d5b09f&attid=0.1&permmsgid=msg-a:r-3290150308485225930&th=19baeddfbf839700&view=fimg&fur=ip&permmsgid=msg-a:r-3290150308485225930&sz=s0-l75-ft&attbid=ANGjdJ9k3BCqmVOC5mK32uUWEGFhrDnfwRQtqsaH9sSvoJgt68v4LdQ2n7-iK4iKjc0a7kizmk6bdgoDBStudGnFDSR6zv5Sii-E_V74e7GhSlF424OK8RJla8qjwu0&disp=emb&realattid=ii_19baeddf379681737f11&zw" alt="My Scalp" style="width:100%">
      <h3>Scalp</h3>
      <p>Near my hairline, I used to have terrible dandruff that made my hair look flaky and unhealthy. After using Ketoconazole 2% shampoo, the dandruff disappeared, my scalp felt soothed and moisturized, and my hair looked softer, shinier, and more manageable.</p>
    </div>
  </div>

